<===> unquoted/normalized/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
$\$: null;
a {b: meta.global-variable-exists(\$)}

<===> unquoted/normalized/output.css
a {
  b: true;
}

<===>
================================================================================
<===> unquoted/non_normalized/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
@use "sass:string";
$\$: null;
a {b: meta.global-variable-exists(unquoted("\\24"))}

<===> unquoted/non_normalized/output.css
a {
  b: false;
}

<===> unquoted/non_normalized/warning
DEPRECATION WARNING [meta-escape]: meta.global-variable-exists() will throw an error or
the unquoted string `unquoted("\\24")` in Dart Sass 3.0.0 because it
isn't a valid CSS identifier.

More info: https://sass-lang.com/d/meta-escape

  ,
4 | a {b: meta.global-variable-exists(unquoted("\\24"))}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
    input.scss 4:7  root stylesheet

