<===> quoted/normalized/input.scss
@use "sass:meta";
$\$: null;
a {b: meta.global-variable-exists("\\$")}

<===> quoted/normalized/output.css
a {
  b: true;
}

<===> quoted/normalized/warning
DEPRECATION WARNING [meta-escape]: meta.global-variable-exists() will interpret the
quoted string "\\$" as the semantic value of an identifier
in Dart Sass 3.0.0. For forwards-compatibility, use an unquoted string instead:

Suggestion: meta.global-variable-exists(\\\$))

More info: https://sass-lang.com/d/meta-escape

  ,
3 | a {b: meta.global-variable-exists("\\$")}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
    input.scss 3:7  root stylesheet

